<li>
<p><m>\left\lbrace\begin{array}{rrrrrrrr}\amp  9 \,x\amp +\amp  6 \, y\amp - \amp 6 \,z\amp =\amp 12\\\amp  -15 \, x\amp - \amp 10 \,y\amp +\amp  10 \, z\amp =\amp -20\\\amp  18 \,x\amp +\amp  12 \, y\amp - \amp 12 \,z\amp =\amp 24\\ \end{array}\right.</m></p>
